WEBVTT

00:06:58.205 --> 00:07:01.000
I brought it with me when I transitioned.

00:07:01.041 --> 00:07:02.835
(Laughter)

00:07:02.877 --> 00:07:05.212
A lot of decades of being a man.

00:07:05.212 --> 00:07:06.380
(Laughter)

00:07:07.214 --> 00:07:09.925
But that doesn't mean
I don't see my power diminishing.

00:07:09.967 --> 00:07:12.261
Let me tell you another thing
I've observed.

00:07:12.261 --> 00:07:16.891
Apparently, since I became a female,
I have become stupid.

00:07:16.932 --> 00:07:20.561
(Laughter)

00:07:20.603 --> 00:07:24.231
Yeah, I guess it's the loss
of testosterone

00:07:24.231 --> 00:07:26.358
and the arrival of estrogen

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:28.819
that has caused me to lose the brain cells

00:07:28.861 --> 00:07:31.989
necessary to be a fully
functioning adult human.